   "_id": 12312,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"2464\" data-start=\"2221\"><strong data-end=\"2462\" data-start=\"2439\">Maximized Criteria: 40%</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"2691\" data-start=\"2465\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2570\" data-start=\"2465\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2570\" data-start=\"2467\"><strong data-end=\"2486\" data-start=\"2467\">CPU Utilization</strong> &ndash; Ensures CPU is always working. <em data-end=\"2530\" data-start=\"2520\">Analogy:</em> Like a busy cashier in a supermarket.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2691\" data-start=\"2571\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2691\" data-start=\"2573\"><strong data-end=\"2587\" data-start=\"2573\">Throughput</strong> &ndash; Number of processes completed per unit time. <em data-end=\"2645\" data-start=\"2635\">Analogy:</em> Number of customers served in a given hour.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"2718\" data-start=\"2693\"><strong data-end=\"2716\" data-start=\"2693\">Minimized Criteria: 40%</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"2904\" data-start=\"2719\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2772\" data-start=\"2719\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2772\" data-start=\"2721\"><strong data-end=\"2737\" data-start=\"2721\">Waiting Time</strong> &ndash; Time spent in the ready queue.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2840\" data-start=\"2773\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2840\" data-start=\"2775\"><strong data-end=\"2794\" data-start=\"2775\">Turnaround Time</strong> &ndash; Total time from submission to completion.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2904\" data-start=\"2841\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2904\" data-start=\"2843\"><strong data-end=\"2860\" data-start=\"2843\">Response Time</strong> &ndash; Time until the first response is given.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"3132\" data-start=\"2906\"><em data-end=\"2927\" data-start=\"2906\">Real-World Example:<strong> 20%</strong></em><br data-end=\"2930\" data-start=\"2927\" />\nImagine a bank with several counters. Efficient scheduling ensures minimum waiting time for customers (processes), fast response by the teller (CPU), and maximum number of customers served (throughput).</p>\n",
