   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p><strong data-end=\"2421\" data-start=\"2219\">Explain the role of synchronization in Interprocess Communication (IPC). Discuss different synchronization mechanisms used in IPC and how they help prevent issues like race conditions and deadlocks.</strong></p>\n",
